  "name": "AppCopilot: Toward General, Accurate, Long-Horizon, and Efficient Mobile Agent",
  "notes": "Trace reuse assumes stable layouts and fixed tasks. The described function-call routes are user-selected, and coordinate calibration depends on valid detected widgets. No particular operating-system coverage, latency guarantee or reproduced result is asserted. Basis: complete retained abstract and source-reviewed sections of the exact-version paper (4.2 OCR/OR Region Localization; 4.2.2 Coordinate Calibration; 4.3 Multi-Agent Voting; 5.2 Task Decomposition; 6.2 Experience Reuse; 6.3 Function Calling); not an entire-paper reading or reproduction claim.",
  "published_at": "2025-09-02",
  "relations": [],
  "review_status": "curated",
  "scope": "core",
  "summary": "Describes a mobile-agent stack combining region-based coordinate correction, hierarchical task planning, multi-agent voting, and reuse of successful interaction traces.",
